<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">The SAVD site guide</span>
      <h1 class="d">Changing the site is <em>easy.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">No code. No stress. Every change on the website works the same way, in three steps.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta"><a class="btn" href="#todo">Show me how<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn--line" href="#help">I’m stuck</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="ed" aria-label="The Shopify theme editor, with the three steps marked">
      <div class="ed__top"><span class="ed__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="ed__pg">Home page<svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="m2 4 3 3 3-3"/></svg></span><span class="ed__save">Save<span class="mk mk--3">3</span></span><span class="mk mk--1">1</span></div>
      <div class="ed__body">
