          <span class="ed__row">SAVD category panels</span>
          <span class="ed__row">SAVD feature image</span>
          <span class="ed__row ed__row--add">+ Add section</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ed__view">
          <div class="ed__hdr"><svg class="wm" viewBox="0 0 2000 344" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="SAVD"><path d="M68 2H354V55H96L62 82V115L96 143H308L375 199V286L308 342H7V289H281L314 261V224L281 196H69L2 140V58Z"/><path d="M492 322L672 2H757L938 322V342H879L720 53H708L549 342H492Z"/><path d="M1042 2H1100L1246 287H1260L1407 2H1464V21L1296 342H1207L1042 21Z"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1603 2H1906L1996 76V268L1906 342H1603ZM1663 55H1879L1934 101V242L1879 288H1663Z"/></svg><i></i></div>
          <div class="ed__ban"><span>Wear<br>the Word</span><b>Shop now</b></div>
          <div class="ed__cards"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>
