    </div>
    <ol class="steps3">
      <li><span class="n">1</span><b>Open the editor</b><p>Shopify › Online Store › Themes › Customize.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">2</span><b>Click what you see</b><p>Click the part of the page you want to change, then type or pick a photo.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">3</span><b>Press Save</b><p>Top right corner. That’s it. Your change is live.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
