<main class="wrap">

  <!-- BASICS -->
  <section class="ch" id="basics">
    <div class="ch__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Start here</span>
      <h2 class="d">The basics</h2>
      <p class="ch__lede">Here’s how to get in. Do this every time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="path"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Online Store</span><i>›</i><span>Themes</span><i>›</i><span>Customize</span></div>

    <h3 class="sub">Five words to know</h3>
    <div class="learn">
      <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mock__bar"><svg class="wm" viewBox="0 0 2000 344" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="SAVD"><path d="M68 2H354V55H96L62 82V115L96 143H308L375 199V286L308 342H7V289H281L314 261V224L281 196H69L2 140V58Z"/><path d="M492 322L672 2H757L938 322V342H879L720 53H708L549 342H492Z"/><path d="M1042 2H1100L1246 287H1260L1407 2H1464V21L1296 342H1207L1042 21Z"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1603 2H1906L1996 76V268L1906 342H1603ZM1663 55H1879L1934 101V242L1879 288H1663Z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="strip strip--a"><span class="strip__lab">Banner</span><span class="callout">Section</span></div>
        <div class="strip strip--b"><span class="strip__lab">Best sellers</span><div class="blocks"><span class="blk">Block</span><span class="blk">Block</span><span class="blk">Block</span></div></div>
        <div class="strip strip--c"><span class="strip__lab">Need prayer?</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="words">
        <div class="word"><b>Section</b><p>One strip of the page, like the banner or a row of products.</p></div>
        <div class="word"><b>Block</b><p>A small piece inside a section, like one slide or one question.</p></div>
        <div class="word"><b>Template</b><p>A saved page layout. All product pages share one.</p></div>
        <div class="word"><b>Theme settings</b><p>Changes for the whole site. Click the gear icon in the editor.</p></div>
        <div class="word"><b>Tag</b><p>A word you add to a product that turns things on, like a “New” sticker.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub">Four simple rules</h3>
    <ul class="rules">
      <li><b>Always press Save</b><p>Nothing goes live until you do.</p></li>
      <li><b>Hide, don’t delete</b><p>Click the eye icon to hide a section. You can bring it back anytime.</p></li>
      <li><b>One product page = all of them</b><p>Changing the product page layout changes it for every product.</p></li>
      <li><b>Not sure? Make a copy</b><p>Themes › ⋯ › Duplicate. Practice on the copy.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- TASKS -->
  <section class="ch" id="todo">
    <div class="ch__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Step by step</span>
      <h2 class="d">I want to…</h2>
      <p class="ch__lede">Find what you need, tap it, and follow the steps.</p>
    </div>
    <label class="find" for="tq"><span class="sr">Search what you want to do</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg><input id="tq" type="search" placeholder="Try “banner”, “sale” or “free shipping”" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <span class="count" id="tcount" aria-live="polite"></span>

    <div id="tasks">
      <div class="tgroup"><h3>Home page</h3>
        <details class="task" id="t-banner"><summary><span class="task__t">Change the big banner at the top</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Home page</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD banner slideshow</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click <b>SAVD banner slideshow</b> on the left.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click a banner to change it, or click <b>Add Banner</b> for a new one.</span></li>
            <li><span>Pick a <b>wide picture</b> for computers and a <b>tall picture</b> for phones.</span></li>
            <li><span>Paste the <b>Link</b> (the page it should open).</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> the words go inside the picture itself. Ask design for both sizes (2400px wide and 1200px wide).</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-rail"><summary><span class="task__t">Change which products show in a row</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Home page</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD product rail</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click the row you want (for example <b>Best sellers</b>).</span></li>
            <li><span>Click a <b>Tab</b> and choose a different <b>Collection</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> the row shows whatever is in that collection. To change the products, change the collection in Shopify.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-ann"><summary><span class="task__t">Change the message bar at the very top</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Header</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD announcement</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click <b>SAVD announcement</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click a <b>Message</b> to edit it, or <b>Add Message</b> for a new one.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> keep each message short so it fits on a phone.</p>
        </div></details>
      </div>

      <div class="tgroup"><h3>Products</h3>
        <details class="task" id="t-new"><summary><span class="task__t">Add a new product so it looks right</span><span class="time">5 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Products</span><i>›</i><span>Add product</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Put the type in the <b>title</b>: “Hoodie”, “Shorts” or “Tee”. The site uses this to pick the right size chart.</span></li>
            <li><span>Add <b>tags</b> (see <a href="#words">Product tags</a>), like <span class="word-tag">New</span>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Use simple color names like Black, White, Green, Navy. They get the right color dot.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-sale"><summary><span class="task__t">Put a product on sale</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Products</span><i>›</i><span>Pricing</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Put the <b>old price</b> in <b>Compare-at price</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Put the <b>sale price</b> in <b>Price</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>. A green “−20%” sticker shows up by itself.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-b2g1"><summary><span class="task__t">Add a product to Buy 2 Get 1</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Products</span><i>›</i><span>Tags</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Open the product.</span></li>
            <li><span>Add the tag <span class="word-tag">B2G1</span>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>. The “Buy 2, get 1 free” line shows up by itself.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> the tag only shows the message. The real discount is set in <b>Shopify › Discounts</b>, so make sure that’s on too.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-final"><summary><span class="task__t">Mark something as final sale</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Open the product in Shopify.</span></li>
            <li><span>Add the tag <span class="word-tag">final-sale</span>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>. The cart now says “Final sale · no returns”.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-dot"><summary><span class="task__t">Fix a color dot that’s the wrong color</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Theme settings</span><i>›</i><span>Color swatches</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click the <b>gear icon</b>, then <b>Color swatches</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Find the color name, or scroll to <b>More colors</b> at the bottom.</span></li>
            <li><span>Type it like this: <span class="word-tag">Sand: #d8c7a3</span></span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> the name has to match the color name on the product exactly.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-reviews"><summary><span class="task__t">Show real customer reviews</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Products</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD reviews</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click <b>SAVD reviews</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click <b>Add block</b> › <b>Apps</b> › <b>Loox</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>. Real reviews replace the sample ones.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>
      </div>

      <div class="tgroup"><h3>Whole site</h3>
        <details class="task" id="t-ship"><summary><span class="task__t">Change the free shipping amount or free gift</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Theme settings</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD</span><i>›</i><span>Offers</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Change <b>Free shipping + gift threshold</b> (now $120).</span></li>
            <li><span>Change <b>Free gift product</b> if the gift is changing.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Also change the real free shipping in <b>Shopify › Settings › Shipping</b> so it matches.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> check the top message bar doesn’t still say the old amount.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-colors"><summary><span class="task__t">Change brand or button colors</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Theme settings</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Click the <b>gear icon</b>, then <b>SAVD</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Change the colors under <b>Brand</b> or <b>Buttons</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>. The whole site updates.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-numbers"><summary><span class="task__t">Update the review numbers (4.7 stars, 18,852 reviews)</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Theme settings</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD</span><i>›</i><span>Reviews</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Type the new <b>Store rating</b>, <b>Review count</b> and <b>Happy customers</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-social"><summary><span class="task__t">Change Instagram, TikTok or other social links</span><span class="time">1 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Theme settings</span><i>›</i><span>SAVD</span><i>›</i><span>Social links</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Paste the full link (starting with https://).</span></li>
            <li><span>Leave a box empty to hide that icon.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>
      </div>

      <div class="tgroup"><h3>Pages &amp; menus</h3>
        <details class="task" id="t-faq"><summary><span class="task__t">Add or change an FAQ question</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Customize</span><i>›</i><span>Pages</span><i>›</i><span>FAQ</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Pick the <b>FAQ page</b> from the page menu at the top of the editor.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click the <b>SAVD FAQ</b> group the question belongs in.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click a question to edit it, or <b>Add block › Question</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-menu"><summary><span class="task__t">Change the menu</span><span class="time">3 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Online Store</span><i>›</i><span>Navigation</span><i>›</i><span>Main menu</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Drag links to reorder. Drag one under another to make a dropdown.</span></li>
            <li><span>Click <b>Add menu item</b> for a new link.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save menu</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Photos in the dropdown:</b> Customize › Header › Add <b>Mega menu card</b>. In “Show under menu item”, type the menu word exactly, like <span class="word-tag">Men</span>.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-colbanner"><summary><span class="task__t">Add a banner photo to a collection page</span><span class="time">2 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Collections</span><i>›</i><span>Metafields</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Open the collection and scroll to the bottom (<b>Metafields</b>).</span></li>
            <li><span>Add a photo to <b>banner</b>, and a tall one to <b>banner mobile</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="good"><b>Good to know:</b> don’t see those boxes? Ask Grant to set them up once.</p>
        </div></details>

        <details class="task" id="t-layout"><summary><span class="task__t">Make a new page with a ready-made layout</span><span class="time">3 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <div class="path path--sm"><span>Shopify admin</span><i>›</i><span>Online Store</span><i>›</i><span>Pages</span><i>›</i><span>Add page</span></div>
          <ol class="how">
            <li><span>Type a title and press <b>Save</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>On the right, find <b>Theme template</b> and pick a layout, like <b>faq</b>, <b>contact</b> or <b>landing</b>.</span></li>
            <li><span>Press <b>Save</b>, then open it in Customize to change the words.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div></details>
      </div>

      <div class="tgroup"><h3>New drops</h3>
        <details class="task" id="t-drop"><summary><span class="task__t">Set up a countdown page for a new drop</span><span class="time">10 min</span><span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="task__body">
          <ol class="how">
