  <section class="ch" id="words">
    <div class="ch__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Shortcuts</span>
      <h2 class="d">Product tags</h2>
      <p class="ch__lede">Add these words as <b>tags</b> on a product in Shopify and the site does the rest. Spell them exactly like this.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="magic">
      <div class="mw"><code>New</code><p>Adds a <b>“New”</b> sticker to the product.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>B2G1</code><p>Shows <b>“Buy 2, get 1 free”</b> on the product.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>final-sale</code><p>Shows <b>“Final sale · no returns”</b> in the cart.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>accessories</code><p>Treats it as an accessory, so <b>no size chart</b>.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>MPS</code><p>Uses the <b>men’s shorts</b> size chart.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>WPS</code><p>Uses the <b>women’s shorts</b> size chart.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>YTH</code><p>Uses the <b>youth</b> size chart.</p></div>
      <div class="mw"><code>OTS-active</code><p>Uses the <b>oversized tee</b> size chart.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="good"><b>No tag needed for sales:</b> just fill in the Compare-at price and the “−%” sticker appears.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- HELP -->
