    <div class="ch__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Don’t panic</span>
      <h2 class="d">Help!</h2>
      <p class="ch__lede">The usual fixes. Most problems take one click.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="qa">
      <details><summary>I changed something but it’s not on the site<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><ul><li>Did you press <b>Save</b>?</li><li>Are you editing the <b>live</b> theme? In Online Store › Themes, the live one is at the top. Copies are below it.</li><li>Refresh the site page.</li></ul></div></details>
      <details><summary>Something disappeared from a product page<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Some parts only show when they should:</p><ul><li><b>Size chart</b> only shows on products with sizes.</li><li><b>Buy 2 Get 1</b> only shows with the <span class="word-tag">B2G1</span> tag.</li><li><b>Goal progress bar</b> only shows once “Raised so far” has a number.</li><li>Someone may have clicked the <b>eye icon</b>. Click it again to show it.</li></ul></div></details>
      <details><summary>A photo is cut off<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Add a separate <b>Mobile image</b> if there’s a box for one. On a plain photo, set the heights to <b>0</b> to show the whole picture.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>The wrong color dot shows on a product<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><p>The color name on the product needs to match a name in <b>Color swatches</b>. See <a href="#t-dot">Fix a color dot</a>.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Reviews show fake sample quotes<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Add the Loox app to that section. See <a href="#t-reviews">Show real customer reviews</a>.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>The cart or a page looks broken<span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 5 4 4 4-4"/></svg></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Don’t try to fix it. Take a screenshot, note the page link, and send it to Grant.</p></div></details>
